          cat > /opt/cloud-lab/ATTACK_VECTORS.md << 'EOF'
        # Cloud Pentest Attack Vectors

        ## S3 Misconfigurations
        1. **Public Bucket**: http://cloud-pentest.lab.local:4566/public-bucket/
        2. **Leaked Credentials**: s3://public-bucket/leaked_creds.txt
